[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 782.629, "timestamp": "00:13:02", "text": "配信をやってみたいと思ってるんです。 さて、ゲーム配信についてですが、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 784.629, "timestamp": "00:13:04", "text": "これが今月最後のゲーム配信になります"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 787.59, "timestamp": "00:13:07", "text": "。 それで、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 791.829, "timestamp": "00:13:11", "text": "最近、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 797.75, "timestamp": "00:13:17", "text": "ゲームをプレイする機会をいただきました。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 801.35, "timestamp": "00:13:21", "text": "このゲームのSteamキーを手に入れたんだ。 これはインドのホラーゲームです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 803.029, "timestamp": "00:13:23", "text": "それで、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 803.75, "timestamp": "00:13:23", "text": "[鼻を鳴らして]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 805.91, "timestamp": "00:13:25", "text": "ああ、もしかしたら"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 808.47, "timestamp": "00:13:28", "text": "それをプレイしてみるべきかもしれないと思ったんだ。  [笑い]"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 812.135, "timestamp": "00:13:32", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "mhm"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 815.75, "timestamp": "00:13:35", "text": "昔は、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 820.389, "timestamp": "00:13:40", "text": "ホラーを配信してほしいという人がたくさんいたのを覚えています。でも、私はいつも"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 822.274, "timestamp": "00:13:42", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "which one"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 824.79, "timestamp": "00:13:44", "text": "言い訳をして、「ホラーはできないかな？」などと言って"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 833.91, "timestamp": "00:13:53", "text": "逃げ回っていました。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 837.67, "timestamp": "00:13:57", "text": "今回は、やってみます"}]